{"4112050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Macaron Mash", "steam_appid": 4112050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Macaron Mash</strong>, a sweet 3D puzzle party inspired by <i>Puzzle Bobble</i>! Adorable marshmallow friends push, roll, and match colorful macarons across a pastel arena. Stack combos, dodge candy disasters like sugar winds, and trigger satisfying chain reactions as you clear the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made as a <i>tiny micro-indie project</i>, Macaron Mash is short, simple, and never time-consuming — just pure, light-hearted fun you can jump into anytime.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or challenge a friend in local 2-player duels — every match is short, chaotic, and full of laugh-out-loud moments. It’s simple to learn but delightfully tricky to master: one wrong move and your tower of sweets might tumble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍬 <strong>Note:</strong> The game currently <strong>doesn’t include a tutorial</strong>, but controls are simple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse &amp; Keyboard (solo play):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Click</strong> → Push macarons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Click</strong> → Pull macarons</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Stick</strong> → Move your marshmallow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Stick</strong> → Adjust camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>East Button (e.g., B on Xbox / Circle on PlayStation)</strong> → Push</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>South Button (e.g., A on Xbox / Cross on PlayStation)</strong> → Pull</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Best enjoyed with a controller</strong>, but fully playable solo with mouse and keyboard too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 I’m a solo indie developer — <strong>any feedback, suggestions, or even roasting are warmly welcome!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/extras/9acea0ed2e684fbcdfb83296094bed62.poster.avif?t=1777037601\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/extras/9acea0ed2e684fbcdfb83296094bed62.webm?t=1777037601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/extras/9acea0ed2e684fbcdfb83296094bed62.mp4?t=1777037601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Macaron Mash</strong>, a sweet 3D puzzle party inspired by <i>Puzzle Bobble</i>! Adorable marshmallow friends push, roll, and match colorful macarons across a pastel arena. Stack combos, dodge candy disasters like sugar winds, and trigger satisfying chain reactions as you clear the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made as a <i>tiny micro-indie project</i>, Macaron Mash is short, simple, and never time-consuming — just pure, light-hearted fun you can jump into anytime.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or challenge a friend in local 2-player duels — every match is short, chaotic, and full of laugh-out-loud moments. It’s simple to learn but delightfully tricky to master: one wrong move and your tower of sweets might tumble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍬 <strong>Note:</strong> The game currently <strong>doesn’t include a tutorial</strong>, but controls are simple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse &amp; Keyboard (solo play):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Click</strong> → Push macarons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Click</strong> → Pull macarons</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Stick</strong> → Move your marshmallow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Stick</strong> → Adjust camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>East Button (e.g., B on Xbox / Circle on PlayStation)</strong> → Push</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>South Button (e.g., A on Xbox / Cross on PlayStation)</strong> → Pull</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Best enjoyed with a controller</strong>, but fully playable solo with mouse and keyboard too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 I’m a solo indie developer — <strong>any feedback, suggestions, or even roasting are warmly welcome!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/extras/9acea0ed2e684fbcdfb83296094bed62.poster.avif?t=1777037601\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/extras/9acea0ed2e684fbcdfb83296094bed62.webm?t=1777037601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/extras/9acea0ed2e684fbcdfb83296094bed62.mp4?t=1777037601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Macaron Mash is a cute 3D candy puzzle where marshmallow players push, match, and pop colorful macarons on a shared arena. Play solo or in sweet 2-player duels filled with sugar chaos and pastel fun!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/1aa2f701c9fad5e333be